  "description": "meme-id: the_look_you_have_on_monday_morning; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a skull symbol, commonly associated with death or danger, juxtaposed with the text 'the look you have on monday morning.' This visual metaphor humorously conveys the universal feeling of dread or exhaustion many people experience at the start of a workweek. The intent is to elicit relatable humor by mapping the negative emotional state of Monday mornings onto the universally recognized symbol of death. While the meme is not targeted at any specific group or community, its use of a skull can be seen as potentially harmful due to its association with death, which may be distressing to some viewers. The meme's intent is not abusive, cyberbullying, hateful, or propagandistic, but its potentially morbid imagery may cause discomfort or be misinterpreted as threatening to those sensitive to death symbolism. The overall intent is to create shared, lighthearted recognition of a common, unpleasant experience.",
